# Page sync — evt screen only

RDCP v1 has **no gesture opcode**. Do not restore `evt input` handling.

Working contract:

- Firmware swipe applies the page locally and emits `evt screen` with the id shown
- Go mcudd adopts **every** known `evt screen` into `/tmp/mcud_active_screen` (pending only rate-limits outbound FIFO `cmd screen`)
- LuCI `getStatus` reads that file — do not change `read_active_screen` / page fields for this feature

Do not echo `cmd screen` on swipe. That fights the panel and hides the active page in LuCI.
